WEBVTT

00:00:01.510 --> 00:00:12.671
Filter Interactions to appeals waiting for review

00:00:12.671 --> 00:00:20.220
Open the oldest appeal

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:24.202
Click Start review to claim it

00:00:24.202 --> 00:00:32.921
Read the agent's reason, then rate the parameter and add a remark

00:00:32.921 --> 00:00:38.265
Keep the AI's ratings for everything nobody disputed

00:00:38.265 --> 00:00:45.214
Click Resolve appeal, then Submit final score

00:00:45.214 --> 00:00:49.601
The QA score is now the call's official score
